claim.claim-text:
a housing (12) having a proximal end (14) and a distal end (16);
a mouthpiece (18) at the proximal end (14) of the housing (12);
a capsule (26) according to any preceding claim disposed in the housing (12); and an induction heating arrangement (50) arranged to inductively heat the induction heatable element (42) and thereby heat the flavour-release medium (40).
